   785 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   786 				; Set_Menu_Demo_Attrs - poke palette_id<<4 into the expanded attribute map's
   787 				; (MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM) cell covering each of the demo overlay's 8 squares,
   788 				; for all MENU_DEMO_SQUARE rows each square spans.  Plain CPU loop (no
   789 				; blitter - a small, one-time boot fixup, overriding whatever D:MENU.MAP
   790 				; supplied for just these cells).  MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM is exactly bank-
   791 				; aligned, so a running byte offset from its start splits cleanly into a
   792 				; bank number (offset's upper nibbles) and a window address (offset's low
   793 				; 12 bits) - recomputed every byte, since the covered rows straddle the
   794 				; $35xxx/$36xxx bank boundary partway through (row 25 already crosses it).
   795 				; Called once from start:, after Load_Menu_Banner_Raw.
   796 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
