   824 				; Ptr_Lo/Hi = this band's 8-byte value table (Menu_Demo_Attr_Cols order).
   825 				; The column loop counter lives in X, not Y: vbsta/vblda clobber Y on every
   826 				; call in __VBXE_AUTO__ mode (vbxe_min.asm), and this loop calls vbsta once
   827 				; per column, so Y cannot survive across it.  Clobbers A/X/Y/Reg1-8.
