   890 				; it's a constant-source fill kicked once at boot (Load_Menu_Banner_Raw) and
   891 				; never touched again, and the 12 BCBs already in bcbs.asm exactly fill the
   892 				; $100-$1FF VBXE VRAM budget (see the memory-map comment at the top of this
   893 				; file); a 13th BCB overflowed BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR across the $200 boundary
   894 				; into the NTSC_Palette load and corrupted it - do not add a new BCB here.
   895 				; Its fixed Dest_Step_X (1) and And mask (0, constant source) already match;
   896 				; Dest_Step_Y0/1 and Width-1/Height-1 are patched once, up front, since they
