  1070 				; Fixed asset filenames - the menu banner is static UI chrome, not part of the
  1071 				; browsable image library, so these are NOT built via Build_Filename (which
  1072 				; reads the current selection out of IMAGE_BANK).  The separator has no asset
  1073 				; file - it is always a fixed-colour blitter fill (see Menu_Sep_Blank).  The
  1074 				; palette has no asset file either - see Load_Menu_Ramps (init_vbxe.asm).
