   202 				; Build_Image_List - rebuild the selector list in IMAGE_BANK through the $2000
   203 				; window, grouped:  ".."  (only below the drive root)  |  sub-directories  |
   204 				; *.MAP files.  Rescan_Images sorts the two real groups A-Z afterwards.
   205 				; Sets ImageCount, Dir_Count and FileStart (index of the first *.MAP row).
   206 				;   - directory pass: OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.*" long DIR format (AUX2 = $80) and keep
   207 				;     only lines carrying SDX's "<DIR>" size-column tag (Line_Has_Dir_Tag).
   208 				;   - file pass:      OPEN "D[n]:PATH*.MAP" short format (AUX2 = $00) as before.
